              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'enyomyo z'orugo orwehinguririize obwo Butaaho n'ebiina byazo n'enkondo zaazo n'emirunga yaazo, n'ebintu byabyo byona ebirikukoresibwa omu buheereza bwabo bwona; kandi mugambe amaziina g'ebintu ebi omuntu weena ashemereire kuheeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.32"
            ]
          }
